Subject: [PATCH 1/2] docs(process): a new integration test joins an existing
 directory suite

Add the rule "New tests join a directory suite" to AGENTS.md "Testing",
a cross-reference in "Code shape", check (d) in step 6 of
.claude/agents/PR-reviewer.md and the decision entry. ISOLATED and
SLOW_BINARIES are exempt.

Fixes #3187

